    "Takeoff": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Fixed-time allowance covering ground roll, rotation and acceleration to climb speed.\n\nLow-speed aerodynamics (vortex lift, high-lift devices) are Phase 4, so the\nmission starts its energy integration at the end state given here.",
